    "en": "Multiprotocol support for the IEEE 802.15.4 radio in your {hardware_name} has been deprecated. Migrate the radio back to Zigbee-only firmware to keep it working in the future.\n\nDisabling multiprotocol support will disable Thread support provided by the {hardware_name}. Your Thread devices will continue working only if you have another Thread border router nearby.\n\nIt will take a few minutes to install the Zigbee firmware and restore a backup.",
